lineups.

This table paraphrases the public NASA SEH Appendix C concern set
(`SRC-EMV-NASA-SEH`, DEC-EMV-004). It is not the appendix, not a second
register, and not ISO 29148 clause coverage (`SRC-EMV-29148` metadata-only).
Do not copy NASA or INCOSE handbook body.

