fail('AC-AFC-SPEC-02','traceability; measurability; allocation','CHK-RE-17 INCOMPLETE; CHK-RE-20 WRONG_LEVEL; CHK-RE-30 INCORRECT','“every COE-ASA-001 floor subsection the template carries” would pass a template that omits part of the floor; COE-ASA-001 instead requires every element of the library’s floor. “spec-and-docs” is a lane, not the D1 component.','The specification under "'`spec/amazon-fantasy-companion/` shall contain every structural-floor element required by COE-ASA-001, bind every product AC-AFC row in at least one section, pass the spec lint and figure lint with zero findings, and produce a byte-identical built file on a second build from unchanged sources.'"', 'Allocation → "'`M2 (rev 0.1), M4 (rev 1.0); D1 specification sources and build (S19, S35)`. Add `COE-ASA-001` to Source; retain SD-012 and SD-022 and Verification=test. Clause identity checked in `Alphazedehq:docs/coe/architecture-specification-authoring/architecture-specification-authoring.sdoc:292`; this receipt claims no publication status for that library.'"')
